  "details": "Incentivize VRC+ with Decorative Nameplates!\n\n- Allow us to change the UI color of the nameplate background.\n\n- I could also see decorative overlays (instead of a color change) such as having a little VR Cat or VR Rat as part of the nameplate.\n\nThese should be pretty subtle and not too distracting. They could also be disabled by users who have 0% nameplate opacity or nameplates disabled entirely.",
